    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about transport",
     "texto": [
      "**Forsinket** means «delayed». **Å rekke bussen** means to get to the bus in time. **Holdeplass** is a stop; **avgang** is a departure."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Changes of form",
     "texto": [
      "In **billetten** and **bussen**, the noun appears in its definite form: «the ticket» and «the bus». **Gjelder** shows that a ticket is still valid."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
